  <div class="poster-hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <p class="poster-hero__eyebrow" data-hero-reveal>SaaS · Agentic AI · UX</p>

  <h1 class="poster-title" id="poster-title" aria-label="SCALABLE PRODUCTS. CLEAR STORIES. BETTER EXPERIENCES.">
    <span class="poster-title__group poster-title__group--complex" data-hero-reveal data-depth="0.35">
      <span>SCALABLE </span>
      <span class="poster-title__outline">PRODUCTS.</span>
    </span>
    <span class="poster-title__group poster-title__group--clear" data-hero-reveal data-depth="0.62">
      <span>Clear</span>
      <span class="poster-title__serif">Stories.</span>
    </span>
    <span class="poster-title__group poster-title__group--better" data-hero-reveal data-depth="0.45">
      <span>Better</span>
      <span>EXPERIENCES.</span>
    </span>
  </h1>

  <div class="poster-objects" aria-label="Was Dynamiq verbindet">
    <div class="poster-object poster-object--positioning" data-poster-object data-depth="0.9" data-hero-reveal>
      <div class="poster-object__face">
        <span class="poster-object__index">01</span>
        <strong>AUTOMATE WORK
</strong>
        <span class="poster-object__note">NOT JUST TASKS</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-object poster-object--story" data-poster-object data-depth="1.15" data-hero-reveal>
      <div class="poster-object__face">
        <span class="poster-object__index">02</span>
        <strong>USER <br>EXPERIENCE</strong>
        <span class="poster-object__note">BUILT TO WORK</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-object poster-object--growth" data-poster-object data-depth="0.75" data-hero-reveal>
      <div class="poster-object__face">
        <span class="poster-object__index">03</span>
        <strong>EXPERIENCE</strong>
        <span class="poster-object__note">FROM COMPLEX TO CLEAR</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="poster-hero__footer" data-hero-reveal>
    <a class="poster-hero__cta" href="#kontakt">Projekt besprechen <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="poster-hero__scroll" href="#how-we-build">Scroll zu How we build <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="build-services section-shell" id="how-we-build" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <header class="build-services__intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">[ 02 · How we build ]</p>
    <h2 id="services-title"><span>AI baut schneller.</span><span>Menschen entscheiden, was sich zu bauen lohnt.</span></h2>
    <p>Bevor wir irgendetwas bauen, beginnt jedes Produkt mit unserer UX-Designerin. Sie klärt Nutzerbedürfnisse, Abläufe und Interaktionen – damit wir nicht schneller Software entwickeln, die am Ende niemand nutzen will. Erst wenn die Produkterfahrung trägt, setzen wir AI ein, um Entwicklung und Umsetzung gezielt zu beschleunigen.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="ux-stat">
    <div class="ux-stat__core">
      <strong class="ux-stat__number" aria-label="91 Prozent"><span aria-hidden="true">9</span><span aria-hidden="true">1</span><span aria-hidden="true">%</span></strong>
      <div class="ux-stat__copy">
        <p>of employees report frustration with inadequate workplace technology.</p>
        <p class="ux-stat__source">Source: KMPG</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ux-first">
      <h3>Deshalb kommt <span>UX</span> zuerst.</h3>
      <ul aria-label="Unsere Haltung"><li>Nicht AI zuerst.</li><li>Nicht Code zuerst.</li><li>Menschen zuerst.</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="service-offer section-shell" id="leistungen" aria-labelledby="offer-title">
  <header class="service-offer__intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">[ 03 · Leistungen ]</p>
    <h2 id="offer-title"><span>Build.</span><span>Integrate.</span><span>Optimize.</span></h2>
    <p>Von neuen SaaS-Produkten bis zur Optimierung bestehender Systeme.</p>
  </header>

  <ol class="capability-list">
    {% for service in home.capabilities %}
      <li class="capability-row">
        <span class="capability-row__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ service.number }}</span>
        <div class="capability-row__title">
          <p>{{ service.label }}</p>
          <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-row__body">
          <p>{{ service.text }}</p>
          <ul class="build-tag-list" aria-label="Leistungsbausteine">
            {% for tag in service.tags %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="about-team section-shell" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <header class="about-team__intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">[ 04 · Über Dynamiq ]</p>
    <h2 id="team-title"><span>Senior expertise.</span><span>Direkt im Projekt.</span></h2>
    <p>Dynamiq ist ein Senior-Team für digitale Produkte.<br>Strategie, UX, Agentic AI und Engineering liegen direkt bei den Menschen, die am Projekt arbeiten.</p>
  </header>
  <ol class="about-team__profiles">
    {% for person in home.team %}
      <li class="about-profile">
        <span class="about-profile__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ person.number }}</span>
        <header class="about-profile__identity">
          <h3>{{ person.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ person.disciplines }}</p>
        </header>
        <strong class="about-profile__proof">{{ person.proof }}</strong>
        <p class="about-profile__description">{{ person.text }}</p>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="contact section-shell" id="kontakt" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <header class="contact-intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">[ 05 · Kontakt ]</p>
    <h2 id="contact-title"><span>Was wollt ihr bauen,</span><span>verbessern oder skalieren?</span></h2>
  </header>
  <div class="contact-body">
    <div class="contact-summary">
      <p>Schreibt uns kurz, wo ihr steht, was ihr lösen wollt und welches Ergebnis ihr erreichen möchtet.</p>
      <p>Im ersten Gespräch klären wir Ziel, Scope und ob wir zusammenpassen.</p>
      <div class="contact-meta">
        <p class="contact-direct"><span>Lieber direkt per E-Mail?</span><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <span class="contact-note">Aus {{ site.location }}. Zusammenarbeit im {{ site.areaServed }}.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form class="contact-form" name="projektanfrage" method="post" action="/danke/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="projektanfrage">
      <p class="form-honeypot" hidden><label>Nicht ausfüllen: <input name="bot-field" type="text"></label></p>

      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="field"><label for="name">Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="email">E-Mail <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="unternehmen">Unternehmen</label><input id="unternehmen" name="unternehmen" type="text" autocomplete="organization"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="website">Bestehendes Produkt / Website</label><input id="website" name="website" type="url" autocomplete="url" inputmode="url"></div>
        <div class="field field-full">
          <label for="leistung">Wobei können wir helfen? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <select id="leistung" name="leistung" required>
            <option value="">Bitte auswählen</option>
            <option value="Product &amp; Strategy">Product &amp; Strategy</option>
            <option value="UX &amp; Product Design">UX &amp; Product Design</option>
            <option value="SaaS Development">SaaS Development</option>
            <option value="Agentic AI">Agentic AI</option>
            <option value="Engineering">Engineering</option>
            <option value="Noch nicht sicher">Noch nicht sicher</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field field-full"><label for="projekt">Worum geht es? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><textarea id="projekt" name="projekt" rows="6" required aria-describedby="projekt-hilfe"></textarea><span class="form-help" id="projekt-hilfe">Ausgangslage, Problem und gewünschtes Ergebnis genügen für den Anfang.</span></div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="start">Wann möchtet ihr starten?</label>
          <select id="start" name="start"><option value="">Bitte auswählen</option><option>So bald wie sinnvoll</option><option>In 1–3 Monaten</option><option>In 3–6 Monaten</option><option>Später oder noch offen</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="budget">Budgetrahmen (optional)</label>
          <select id="budget" name="budget">
          <option value="">Keine Angabe</option>
          <option>10.000–20.000 €</option>
          <option>20.000–40.000 €</option>
          <option>40.000–75.000 €</option>
          <option>75.000 € oder mehr</option></select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="consent-field">
        <input id="datenschutz-zustimmung" name="datenschutz-zustimmung" type="checkbox" value="zugestimmt" required>
        <label for="datenschutz-zustimmung">Ich stimme zu, dass meine Angaben zur Bearbeitung der Anfrage verarbeitet werden. Weitere Informationen stehen in der <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzerklärung</a>. <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      </div>
      <p class="required-note"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> Pflichtfeld</p>
      <button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Projekt besprechen</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
